error[E0277]: `&'static u64` can hold a reference, which a read-modify-write writes with `Release`
  --> tests/compile_fail/reference_swap_with_acquire.rs:14:49
   |
14 |     let _ = CONFIG.swap(Box::leak(Box::new(8)), Acquire);
   |                    ----                         ^^^^^^^ publishes nothing
   |                    |
   |                    required by a bound introduced by this call
   |
   = help: the trait `PublishesNoReference` is not implemented for `&'static u64`
   = note: a reference written with `Release` publishes the writes that made what it points to, which a thread that reads it with `Acquire` sees: `AcqRel` or `SeqCst` orders both
help: the trait `RmwOrdering<T>` is conditionally implemented for `atomix_core::ordering::Acquire`
  --> src/ordering.rs
   |
   | impl<T: PublishesNoReference> RmwOrdering<T> for Acquire {}
   | ^^^^^^^^--------------------^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |         |
   |         unsatisfied requirement introduced here: `_: PublishesNoReference`
   = note: required for `atomix_core::ordering::Acquire` to implement `RmwOrdering<&'static u64>`
